        // 第二航次日志/卸渔 31：申报阶段（配额按申报量 vs 已用 70）31 与已用不超？申报仅 31，未超 100。
        // 核销时 70+31>100 必须整笔回滚：航次不结案、余额不变。
        runTripToDischarged(service, vessel, "T-RB-002",
                SyntheticDataInitializer.SPECIES_HAIRTAIL, "31.000");
        assertThrows(BusinessRuleException.class,
                () -> service.settle(settlementRequest("T-RB-002")));

        assertEquals("DISCHARGED", tripStatus("T-RB-002"));
        assertEquals(new BigDecimal("70.000"), usedQuota(vessel, SyntheticDataInitializer.SPECIES_HAIRTAIL));
        assertEquals(0L, countSettlements("T-RB-002"));
    }

    @Test
    void unknownVesselReturnsNotFound() {
        Instant now = Instant.parse("2026-03-14T00:00:00Z");
        com.example.starter.fishery.api.NotFoundException ex = assertThrows(
                com.example.starter.fishery.api.NotFoundException.class,
                () -> service.declareDeparture(departureRequest("T-404", "V-NOPE", now,
                        SyntheticDataInitializer.SPECIES_HAIRTAIL, "1")));
        assertTrue(ex.getMessage().contains("渔船"));
    }
}

